# name: test/parquet/corrupt/brotli_short_output.test
# description: Reject Brotli pages that decompress to fewer bytes than declared
# group: [corrupt]

require parquet

# The page declares 100 uncompressed bytes, but the Brotli stream produces only four.
statement error
SELECT * FROM read_parquet('data/parquet-testing/corrupt/brotli_short_output.parquet');
----
<REGEX>:Data Corruption Error: Failed to read file ".*": Brotli uncompressed data size mismatch \(expected 100, actual: 4\).*
